{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One row of the group-mapping table (G-3, T23.3.4, D-30): a directory group, named by its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinguished name, and the AXIAM group a member of it is put into. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The table is the only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"way a directory group reaches an AXIAM group."}]},{"type":"text","text":" There is no match by name, no prefix or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wildcard, and no AXIAM group is ever created from a directory one: a directory administrator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"who names a group "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"admins"},{"type":"text","text":" gains nothing unless a tenant administrator mapped it here. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"DN is stored as the administrator typed it and compared after RFC 4514 normalisation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"axiam_directory::dn"},{"type":"text","text":"), so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CN=Staff, OU=Groups"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cn=staff,ou=groups"},{"type":"text","text":" are the same row."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"One DN may map to several AXIAM groups; the same (DN, group) pair twice is refused as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redundant."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping\/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping\/init(from:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers